# Z.AI GLM-4.6-Flash — findings by Nemotron 3.5 Super VL 120B A12B

> Source: Z.AI (glm-4.6-flash)
> Date: 2026-10-25 (UTC)
> Overview and scoring methodology: ../../model-comparison.md
> Cross-model signed log: ../../model-findings.md

## Model card

- **Name:** GLM-4.6-Flash (also listed as GLM-4.6V-Flash on Hugging Face)
- **Short description:** Z.AI's flash variant in the GLM-4.6 multimodal MoE family; text+image input, text output; part of GLM-4.6V series (108B total / 12B active per AA).
- **Provider / access:** Hugging Face (`zai-org/GLM-4.6V-Flash`), Z.AI API. MIT license.
- **Release / knowledge:** GLM-4.6V released December 2025 (AA); newer GLM-5.3 series exists per AA.
- **IDs:** `glm-4.6-flash` (Z.AI API slug); `zai-org/GLM-4.6V-Flash` (HF).
- **Context window:** 128k tokens (AA for GLM-4.6V family; benchgap context not specified for Flash variant).
- **Modalities:** Text + image input; text output. Tool calling supported (XML tool format in chat template).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-25):** GLM-4.6V (Reasoning) $0.30 in / $0.90 out per 1M per AA; Flash variant pricing not separately published.
- **Architecture:** MoE; 108B total / 12B active per token (AA for GLM-4.6V family; Flash variant parameter count not separately published). License MIT.

### Raw benchmarks found

- Artificial Analysis (GLM-4.6V family): Intelligence Index **11** (estimated; #15/67 open-weights, median 8); speed 83.9 tok/s (#17/26); cost $0.30 in / $0.90 out per 1M; context 128k; text+image input.
- benchgap (GLM-4.6 family, 12 measured / 46 estimated, data 2026-10-24): GPQA Diamond 81.4% estimated ±1.7 pp; LiveCodeBench v6 86.2% estimated ±2.4 pp; SWE-bench Verified 72.2% estimated ±4.4 pp; MMLU-Pro 78.4% estimated ±6.2 pp; IFEval 87.5% estimated ±2.7 pp; Vals LiveCodeBench 81.0% measured; Vals GPQA Diamond 74.5% measured; Vals MMLU-Pro 82.2% measured; τ²-bench results 76.9% measured.
- Conflicts: benchgap/AA data is for GLM-4.6/GLM-4.6V family, not Flash-specific; Flash variant parameter count not separately published; official blog page returned no content.

### Normalized scores (1–100)

- Tool use: **72/100.** Tool calling (XML format) supported; agent capabilities per GLM-4.6 family positioning; limited independent agentic replication.
- Reasoning: **68/100.** AA Intelligence Index 11 (est) above small-model median; GPQA Diamond 81.4% estimated; Flash variant not separately benchmarked.
- Context window: **65/100.** 128k tokens; below 256K+ of newer models.
- Multimodal: **80/100.** Text+image input per AA (GLM-4.6V family); image benchmarks strong (MMMLU 83.3% estimated).
- Coding: **70/100.** LiveCodeBench v6 86.2% estimated; SWE-bench Verified 72.2% estimated; Vals LiveCodeBench 81.0% measured.
- Cost efficiency: **70/100.** GLM-4.6V pricing $0.30/$0.90 per 1M is above class medians ($0.15/$0.43); Flash variant pricing unknown.
- **Overall Score: 71/100.** Half-up mean of the five non-cost dims; best-fit recommendation: flash-tier multimodal agentic workloads where speed and cost matter; Flash-specific data limited — verify against GLM-4.6V family numbers.

